{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜解讀以色列大選(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-29-13-04-366HHVdPEX.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：解讀以色列大選</p><p>以色列大選投票結束，投票率創下紀錄，總理內塔尼亞胡領導的執政陣營與反對派陣營，均未能取得國會過半數議席，關鍵「造王者」如何左右政壇大局？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>中華縱橫學術社社長曹希聖</p><p>聯校國際關係及外交學會顧問潘學智</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:00:56.550994+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.330615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:17.123641+00:00","content_hash":"5824f1f7e2f01444d8a167c95e546e24455820bbf6f79f7a1d6b6371252b02f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:00:56.550994+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}